OL,3,GNEWSAJurassic Coast fossil records made
OL,4,Aavailable online
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of scientifically important
OL,7,Ffossil records from the Jurassic Coast
OL,8,Fhave been made publicly available for
OL,9,Fthe first time in a new digital
OL,10,Fcatalogue.
OL,12,FThe Fossil Codes website features more
OL,13,Fthan 600 scientifically important
OL,14,Fspecimens from the rapidly eroding
OL,15,FDorset and East Devon coast.
OL,17,FIt means the images and records are now
OL,18,Favailable to researchers, museums and
OL,19,Fcommunities around the world, while
OL,20,Fcollectors and fossil hunters can also
OL,21,Fdigitally record new discoveries.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
